        "source_sha256": "7c125dc1c5caea76b95979b9bc69dd468f8812e2ca44cc553be4f496c59c412c",
        "text": "- Meet Tonya\n- Video Series\n- Endorsements\n# Tonya Connolly Campaign\nMake sure to follow us on Facebook!\nFirst name Last name Email Zip/Postal Message\nBy providing your information you consent to receive messages. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Text STOP to opt out.\nThank you for signing up!\n# Why I’m Running\nI’m running for City Council with one clear purpose: to be a dedicated, full-time voice for the people of Newark. I have the time, energy, and focus to give this city my undivided attention.\nI’m not here to build a political resume or use this seat as a stepping-stone to higher office—my sole focus is a safe, stable, and sustainable Newark. That begins with fiscal common sense. Before City Hall takes on new spending commitments, we must maintain what we already have. Facing a projected deficit in fiscal year 2029, business as usual is no longer an option. Newark needs disciplined leadership prepared to eliminate waste, protect essential neighborhood services, and ensure our long-term financial health.\nOver the next several weeks, I’ll be releasing videos introducing myself and outlining my vision for the future of Newark. Take a look here or on Facebook—I welcome your comments, questions, and positive ideas as we start this conversation together!\n- Yard Signs\n- Photos\n- Contact\n- Privacy Policy\n- Home\nPaid for by Connolly for Newark City Council 2026 [FPPC #1496709]\nPowered by CampaignPartner.com\n- Home\n- Meet Tonya\n- Video Series\n- Yard Signs\n- Contact\n- Photos\nClose Menu",
        "text_limited": false,
        "title": "Tonya Connolly for City Council | Newark",
        "unresolved_images": []
      }
