            "heading": "",
            "index": 1,
            "nearby": "On behalf of the BWOPA Hayward/South County Chapter, I am pleased to share that BWOPA CA PAC has officially endorsed your candidacy for Newark City Council, following the endorsement recommendation submitted by our chapter. Black Women Organized for Political Action California",
            "observation_id": "I-e8282483e4607a5eecc0b5d0",
