        "text": "- Meet Tonya\n- Video Series\n- Endorsements\nOn behalf of the BWOPA Hayward/South County Chapter, I am pleased to share that BWOPA CA PAC has officially endorsed your candidacy for Newark City Council, following the endorsement recommendation submitted by our chapter.\nBlack Women Organized for Political Action California\nI am deeply proud and grateful to announce that the International Association of Fire Fighters (IAFF) Local 55 has officially endorsed my candidacy for Newark City Council.\nOur first responders put their lives on the line every single day to protect our families, homes, and neighborhoods. Earning their trust and support means the world to me. In their endorsement, IAFF Local 55 highlighted our shared commitment to public safety, noting a strong understanding of firefighter issues and a dedicated vision for the fire department and the Newark community.\nThank you to President Aaron Lee, the executive board, the political committee, and every brave firefighter of Local 55 for your service and dedication to the City of Newark. Together, we will continue working to ensure our first responders have the resources, equipment, and backing they need to keep Newark safe and strong.\nInternational Association of Firefighters Local 55\nClick here to add your endorsement\n- Yard Signs\n- Photos\n- Contact\n- Privacy Policy\n- Home\nPaid for by Connolly for Newark City Council 2026 [FPPC #1496709]\nPowered by CampaignPartner.com\n- Home\n- Meet Tonya\n- Video Series\n- Yard Signs\n- Contact\n- Photos\nClose Menu",
